---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";

import Link from "@/src/components/Link.astro";
import Page from "@/src/components/ui/blocks/page/Page.astro";
import PageHeader from "@/src/components/ui/blocks/page/PageHeader.astro";
import Section from "@/src/components/ui/blocks/section/Section.astro";
import Card from "@/src/components/ui/elements/card/Card.astro";
import CardContent from "@/src/components/ui/elements/card/CardContent.astro";
import automatedVehicleImage from "@/src/content/library/pcb/images/Automated-Vehicle-Peer-Exchanges-Thumb.png";
import v2xTollingImage from "@/src/content/library/pcb/images/V2X-and-Tolling-Peer-Exchange-thumb.png";
import base_url from "@/src/lib/base_url";

import Layout from "../_layout.astro";
---

<style>
  .exchange-navigation {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .exchange-section {
    scroll-margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .exchange-layout {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--size-lg);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .exchange-image {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 28rem;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .materials-list {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .materials-list li + li {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .materials-list a {
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .materials-note {
    color: #595959;
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 992px) {
    .exchange-layout {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.7fr) minmax(0, 1.5fr);
    }
  }
</style>

<Layout>
  <Page as="div" class="tw:gap-12">
    <PageHeader title="ITS Peer Exchanges">
      <Fragment slot="description">
        <p class="program-text">
          Intelligent Transportation Systems (ITS) Peer Exchanges bring together
          transportation professionals, public agencies, industry partners, and
          subject matter experts to share experiences, explore emerging
          technologies, and discuss opportunities and challenges related to the
          deployment of intelligent transportation systems.
        </p>
        <p class="program-text">
          These peer exchanges provide a collaborative environment for sharing
          knowledge, highlighting lessons learned, discussing best practices,
          and identifying opportunities to advance ITS deployment across the
          transportation community.
        </p>
        <p class="program-text">
          Explore the peer exchanges below and access presentation materials,
          resources, and other event-related content.
        </p>
        <p class="program-text">
          If your agency is interested in conducting a peer exchange, please
          contact the ITS PCB Program at <Link
            href="mailto:itspcb@dot.gov"
            isExternal>itspcb@dot.gov</Link
          >.
        </p>
      </Fragment>
    </PageHeader>

    <Section color="muted" size="lg">
      <article
        aria-labelledby="automated-vehicle-title"
        class="exchange-section"
        id="automated-vehicle"
      >
        <h3 class="program-title-md mb-4" id="automated-vehicle-title">
          Automated Vehicle Peer Exchanges
        </h3>
        <div class="exchange-layout">
          <Image
            alt="View from inside an automated vehicle near the Golden Gate Bridge."
            class="exchange-image"
            sizes="(min-width: 992px) 260px, (min-width: 496px) 448px, calc(100vw - 48px)"
            src={automatedVehicleImage}
            widths={[320, 520, 780]}
          />
          <div>
            <p class="program-text">
              The Automated Vehicle Peer Exchange brought together state and
              local agencies and other stakeholders to share experiences,
              lessons learned, and perspectives on automated vehicle
              deployments. The peer exchange was led by USDOT in partnership
              with the San Francisco County Transportation Authority (SFCTA) and
              was conducted September 9-11, 2026 in San Francisco, CA.
              Throughout the peer exchange, participants engaged in discussion
              and interactive activities grounded around four topic areas:
            </p>
            <ol class="program-list mb-0">
              <li>Planning, Policy, and Public Engagement</li>
              <li>Permitting Frameworks and Regulations</li>
              <li>Operations, Enforcement, and Emergency Response</li>
              <li>Data Collection and Performance Assessment</li>
            </ol>
          </div>
          <Card class="tw:shadow-none" id="automated-vehicle-materials">
            <CardContent>
              <h4 class="program-title-sm mb-3">
                Download Peer Exchange Materials
              </h4>
              <p class="program-text">
                Access presentation slides, meeting materials, and other
                resources from the Automated Vehicle Peer Exchanges.
              </p>
              <!-- Replace the presentations placeholder href when the file is available. -->
              <ul class="program-list materials-list">
                <li>
                  <a
                    href={base_url(
                      "/assets/pcb/peer-exchanges/USDOT-Automated-Vehicle-Peer-Exchange-Agenda.pdf",
                    )}>USDOT Automated Vehicle Peer Exchange Agenda</a
                  >
                </li>
                <li>
                  <a href="#automated-vehicle-materials"
                    >USDOT Automated Vehicle Peer Exchange Presentations</a
                  >
                </li>
                <li>
                  <a
                    href={base_url(
                      "/assets/pcb/peer-exchanges/USDOT-Automated-Vehicle-Peer-Exchange-Posters.pdf",
                    )}>USDOT Automated Vehicle Peer Exchange - Poster Session</a
                  >
                </li>
              </ul>
            </CardContent>
          </Card>
        </div>
      </article>
    </Section>

    <Section>
      <article
        aria-labelledby="v2x-and-tolling-title"
        class="exchange-section"
        id="v2x-and-tolling"
      >
        <h3 class="program-title-md mb-4" id="v2x-and-tolling-title">
          V2X and Tolling Peer Exchange
        </h3>
        <div class="exchange-layout">
          <Image
            alt="Connected vehicle demonstration with a display showing a toll zone ahead."
            class="exchange-image"
            sizes="(min-width: 992px) 260px, (min-width: 496px) 448px, calc(100vw - 48px)"
            src={v2xTollingImage}
            widths={[320, 520, 780]}
          />
          <div>
            <p class="program-text mb-0">
              The V2X and Tolling Peer Exchange explores the intersection of
              vehicle-to-everything (V2X) technologies and electronic tolling
              systems. This virtual exchange provided a forum to discuss
              opportunities for leveraging V2X technologies to support tolling
              operations, improve transportation system efficiency, and advance
              interoperability. Topics include V2X applications, connected
              vehicle infrastructure, tolling technology integration, deployment
              considerations, and opportunities for collaboration across the
              transportation and tolling communities.
            </p>
          </div>
          <Card class="tw:shadow-none" id="v2x-and-tolling-materials">
            <CardContent>
              <h4 class="program-title-sm mb-3">
                Download Peer Exchange Materials
              </h4>
              <p class="program-text">
                Access presentation slides, discussion materials, and other
                resources from the V2X and Tolling Peer Exchange.
              </p>
              <h5 class="program-title-xs mb-3">
                October 28th Peer Exchange Session
              </h5>
              <!-- Replace the presentations placeholder href when the file is available. -->
              <ul class="program-list materials-list">
                <li>
                  <a
                    href={base_url(
                      "/assets/pcb/peer-exchanges/USDOT-V2X-and-Tolling-Peer-Exchange-Agenda-Final.pdf",
                    )}
                    >USDOT V2X and Tolling Peer Exchange Agenda &ndash; October
                    28, 2026</a
                  >
                </li>
                <li>
                  <a href="#v2x-and-tolling-materials"
                    >USDOT V2X and Tolling Peer Exchange Presentations &ndash;
                    October 28, 2026</a
                  >
                </li>
              </ul>
            </CardContent>
          </Card>
        </div>
      </article>
    </Section>
  </Page>
</Layout>
